{"publicId":"0d6214e1-bb81-482d-980a-a9f04521865e","title":"某团队开发单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq用于16S rRNA及耐药基因分析","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","digest":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq，通过单一多联PCR扩增16S rRNA（约1500bp）和8种耐药基因（600-700bp），经纳米孔测序验证双片段同步扩增均一性（Pearson相关系数r=0.879）。\n\n传统方法需多管独立扩增16S rRNA和耐药基因，而RAMP-Seq实现单管同步扩增，简化实验流程。该方法目前仅以预印本形式在bioRxiv发布，尚未完成同行评审与正式发表验证。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-13T21:42:37.182Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq","latestReport":{"id":"b3euu4zzkdlq311lti3ynzmyj"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f4X-VTCZ8tY4","title":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"b3euu4zzkdlq311lti3ynzmyj","title":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq","summary":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq，该技术通过单一多联PCR扩增16S rRNA（约1500bp）和8种耐药基因（600-700bp），经纳米孔测序验证了双片段同步扩增的均一性（Pearson相关系数r=0.879）。","source":{"name":"bioRxiv","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"b3euu4zzkdlq311lti3ynzmyj","title":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq","summary":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq，该技术通过单一多联PCR扩增16S rRNA（约1500bp）和8种耐药基因（600-700bp），经纳米孔测序验证了双片段同步扩增的均一性（Pearson相关系数r=0.879）。","source":{"name":"bioRxiv","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"b3euu4zzkdlq311lti3ynzmyj","title":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq","summary":"某团队在bioRxiv发表单管纳米孔测序方法RAMP-Seq，该技术通过单一多联PCR扩增16S rRNA（约1500bp）和8种耐药基因（600-700bp），经纳米孔测序验证了双片段同步扩增的均一性（Pearson相关系数r=0.879）。","source":{"name":"bioRxiv","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T23:00:00.000Z","heat":5.1,"partici